      "description": "Static scanner (sast-scan) flagged subprocess.run at line 6 as a dangerous call. shell=False reduces classic shell injection, but repo_url is passed directly to git clone and an untrusted value beginning with '-' could be interpreted as a git option (e.g. --upload-pack), potentially enabling command execution. Validate/allow-list repo_url and insert '--' before it if untrusted input must be supported.",
